00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.600
Why I have that gift? I'll never know.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.933
Why God has picked me to be this?

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:55.790
I don't know anymore.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:02.600
I'm like, I hate everything right now.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.223
Just because they targeted me.

00:11:07.205 --> 00:11:09.255
And I never did nothing to nobody. (sobs)

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.773
Well, I wanna see my
people, and I'm going to.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.283
No matter where they're
at, I'm gonna find them.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.473
I don't care.

00:11:21.473 --> 00:11:23.130
Whenever I unlock that one door

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:26.733
down in that cellar, wherever it was,

00:11:28.339 --> 00:11:33.290
1,800 feet or 1,600 feet

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.400
and underneath ground,

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:37.370
and there's one elevator up and one down.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.603
You wouldn't be scared.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.320
That was must take like 10 minutes

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.760
to get down to where you're going

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.823
or even a little longer,
maybe 15 or 20 minutes.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.700
And to know that you're never
coming out of that spot again?

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.323
I couldn't do it to anybody.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.940
So I've learned a lot.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.780
Like Cortell has always taught me

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:08.253
because they have the best.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.540
They are the terminator.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.775
I'm not lying to you.

00:12:11.775 --> 00:12:13.233
They have cloned people.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:18.873
Thank God. Jesus showed me this big thing.

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:21.961
It's like a salad. (laughs)

00:12:21.961 --> 00:12:24.340
And I said, "Well, how
are you fuckin stacking

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.377
those motherfuckers?"
I asked him like that.

00:12:27.377 --> 00:12:28.642
"How do you stack them?"

00:12:28.642 --> 00:12:31.142
(siren wails)

00:12:33.895 --> 00:12:38.603
I said, "Wow, so you cloned
every person that you wanted?"

00:12:38.603 --> 00:12:40.539
And he said, "Yeah."

00:12:40.539 --> 00:12:43.339
So I said, "You taught my dad
how to do that shit, huh?"

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.773
Cause my friends, one of them right here,

00:12:48.806 --> 00:12:53.806
1677, he was born.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.680
Another one, Vicente Fernandez,

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:00.223
he told me he was born in 1739.

00:13:02.094 --> 00:13:04.790
I have a hermaphrodite friend.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.520
She was back in the...

00:13:08.255 --> 00:13:10.570
I don't know, where
they'd have big parades.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.940
There was big ass elephants, huge ones,

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:18.940
and they're like little
people like the gypsy days,

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.520
shit like that.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.353
And I'm just like,

00:13:22.353 --> 00:13:25.223
"Is this shit really real, or
are they just fuckin with me?

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:27.903
Like, is this all really real?

00:13:29.519 --> 00:13:34.457
I don't know, you know?

00:13:34.457 --> 00:13:35.590
Because I mean...

00:13:38.611 --> 00:13:39.550
I don't know.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.863
But today is the day.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:45.204
I said today is the day it's
coming out, no matter what,

00:13:45.204 --> 00:13:47.080
cause I found that blue thing.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:50.663
Now if there's nothing else in my body,

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:52.743
I got it.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.563
For sure, I got it.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.480
- [Mark] So I ask this
question of a lot of people

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.470
that I interviewed,

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.323
what's the most important
lesson you've learned?

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:09.273
- The most important lesson, always study.

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.433
You never stop learning.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.800
That's the most important thing.

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.430
When I heard that, when I was like...

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.570
I think I was five years
old when I heard that.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.001
My teacher said never stop learning.

00:14:23.001 --> 00:14:24.660
If there's anything, we'd go in class,

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:27.733
she'd say, "Good morning.
You never stop learning.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.880
Today, we're gonna learn."

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.560
And that's all right.

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:35.260
So like, yeah, I always am doing...

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:38.700
And that's why maybe I
have the worst case maybe,

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.473
but right now at this time,

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.020
I had to get it all out,

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.430
and then I gotta...

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.327
As soon as I get it out of me,

00:14:50.327 --> 00:14:53.040
and I tell guys, sew up.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.500
Go get some...

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.333
You get...

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.380
What is that called?

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.720
Super glue.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.913
And you glue up your inside,

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.763
that's what you do, you glue it.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.830
With super glue. I swear to God.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.940
That's the only thing
because it has to be fast

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:17.560
because when I got the
stitches in my head,

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.440
when somebody hit me over the
head with a brick real hard,

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.840
it cracked my whole skull open.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.771
My skull's still cracked.

00:15:24.771 --> 00:15:25.957
- [Mark] When did this happen?

00:15:25.957 --> 00:15:27.970
- It happen in the valley a long time ago.

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:32.970
But, yeah, I don't know. (laughs)

00:15:36.159 --> 00:15:37.460
I don't know. I can't explain it.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.030
- [Mark] Ruby, you're so fascinating.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.320
- God and I wanted out so bad.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.350
It's like, "Why don't you just like fester

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:44.782
out of there or something?"

00:15:44.782 --> 00:15:47.792
It's this one. When I go
outside, I gotta do it.

00:15:47.792 --> 00:15:49.709
Watch, I'm gonna do it.

00:15:51.746 --> 00:15:53.730
- [Mark] All right, Ruby.
Thanks for coming by again.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.570
- Yeah, sure, man. I'm not crazy.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:58.340
I haven't lost my mind.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.750
I'm not going to a mental ward.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.483
And I do this for him
because I like my friend.

00:16:06.089 --> 00:16:08.940
I hate saying he's my friend

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.400
because it's really scary, life out there.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:16.050
And I hate that word right now, friend,

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.303
because it's so scary for you guys.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.500
And they locked him downstairs,

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:26.500
I said, all right, that's
one of us, I'll be checking.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.040
That's why I don't leave here right now.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.433
So why people they're
watching you at all times,

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.943
And you'll be sick. I promise you that.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.397
I believe that.
- It's great feedback.

00:16:38.397 --> 00:16:39.230
That's great to know.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.063
- Yes, sir.

00:16:40.063 --> 00:16:42.517
Or I'm doing everything
I can to protect him.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.110
Cause I have my ways.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.225
So I know if you're in here,

00:16:46.225 --> 00:16:49.389
a lot of people can't do it no more.

00:16:49.389 --> 00:16:51.790
Even if it's upstairs, downstairs,

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:54.150
I don't give a fuck what
they try side to side,

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.130
they can't keep you in here.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.491
Now, that's what's weird.

00:16:57.491 --> 00:16:59.569
The equators right across the street.

00:16:59.569 --> 00:17:00.402
Do you know that?

00:17:00.402 --> 00:17:01.235
- [Mark] The equator?

00:17:01.235 --> 00:17:02.068
- The equator.

00:17:02.068 --> 00:17:02.901
(Mark laughs)

00:17:02.901 --> 00:17:05.683
- Listen to me, that door
across the street is hollow.

00:17:07.955 --> 00:17:11.843
The equator is right in underneath us.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:16.080
I don't know how they leveled the deck,

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:19.440
but it's a hole all the way
down, and it goes around.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:22.533
I don't know how far in the
seat, but it's right here.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:26.170
I swear by God on my life.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.070
I asked the wetbacks, right?

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.640
I said, "Is it right here?"

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:32.132
And he said, "Yep, cause
I found it one day."

00:17:32.132 --> 00:17:34.410
And he said, "Yes, it is."

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:36.730
And I said, "I found it, finally."

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.410
So the real...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.797
Not the equator, but
the like abominable pit,

00:17:41.797 --> 00:17:45.430
go down, down, down, it's
right across the street.

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.760
So if you'd need to dispose of any bodies,

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.363
I'd tell them to drop
it right there. (laughs)

00:17:52.307 --> 00:17:53.396
You get rid of everything.

00:17:53.396 --> 00:17:54.229
- [Mark] All right, thank you, Ruby.

00:17:54.229 --> 00:17:55.446
- [Ruby] Yes, sir.

00:17:55.446 --> 00:17:57.720
That's the truth, brother. You hear me?

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:58.830
- [Mark] You're always fascinating.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:17:59.780
- [Ruby] I wouldn't lie to you.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.499
That's what they told
me and they're right.

00:18:02.499 --> 00:18:03.332
- [Mark] Yeah, I'll bet they are.

00:18:03.332 --> 00:18:04.576
- [Ruby] Oh yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:18:04.576 --> 00:18:06.050
Will you hit me with that thing?

